libultraship for the Apple Watch, applied by tools/build-oot.sh.

- src/CMakeLists.txt: LUS_WATCH_PORT_SOURCES / LUS_WATCH_PORT_INCLUDES compile
  the watch's backends (port/oot) into the library and define LUS_WATCH_PORT.
- src/fast/Fast3dWindow.cpp: with LUS_WATCH_PORT, the software renderer and
  the fixed-size window backend, and no ImGui composite: the game fills the
  window and the renderer publishes it.
- src/ship/audio/Audio.cpp, src/libultraship/libultra/os.cpp: the watch's audio
  player and controller input.
- CMakeLists.txt, src/*/CMakeLists.txt, AudioPlayer.h, Audio.cpp,
  Fast3dGui.cpp: a watchOS platform (__WATCHOS__) without Metal, OpenGL,
  Core Audio or the SDL window backend.

